{"title":"2017 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Fastest_Way)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Fastest Way)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_CRITICALLY_THINK!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO CRITICALLY THINK!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Mary thought of a positive two-digit number. She multiplied it by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and added <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Then she switched the digits of the result, obtaining a number between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, inclusive. What was Mary's number? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/3/8339bfd778ccd475ef5e201a99364b29e5003095.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 11\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 12\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 13\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 14\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let her <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-digit number be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Multiplying by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> makes it a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, meaning that the sum of its digits is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Adding on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> increases the sum of the digits by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/2/3724c72b495927cdf30766977d7e1b80c28324bb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+1 = 2,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"77\" height=\"15\" /> (we can ignore numbers such as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/7/4d79fb19ef93982da62a012db4a7a9d36d9115fc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$39+11=50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"100\" height=\"14\" />) and reversing the digits keeps the sum of the digits the same; this means that the resulting number must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> more than a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. There are two such numbers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/9/ea9b58be20255fc7a367ccf62d1b60384f0b624e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> Now that we have narrowed down the choices, we can simply test the answers to see which one will provide a two-digit number when the steps are reversed:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/f/57f1406b65f9f2e6a365b7356da731780b42cceb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\]\" />\nFor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/9/aa9fa1f5612d7d7d238f3a9161cf72451c2a8a36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"25\" height=\"17\" /> we reverse the digits, resulting in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/d/55d9112910335dfe813b84b8d9db66a08dcf5a2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/e/1de3ed5fb7fa9b1fa73395d65c43e5bc81cd9d61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6.$\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" /> We can already see that dividing this by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> will not be a two-digit number, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> does not meet our requirements.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/f/57f1406b65f9f2e6a365b7356da731780b42cceb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\]\" />\nTherefore, the answer must be the reversed steps applied to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/9/ea9b58be20255fc7a367ccf62d1b60384f0b624e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"12\" /> We have the following:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/f/57f1406b65f9f2e6a365b7356da731780b42cceb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\]\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/e/abe8c018d835cba8b6691f4e981db34eb837a94c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74\\rightarrow47\\rightarrow36\\rightarrow12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"159\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/f/57f1406b65f9f2e6a365b7356da731780b42cceb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\]\" />\nTherefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/9/219de30318b3d8dadb300c7b7f6e349e34d523b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\bold{(B)} 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"59\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Working backwards, we reverse the digits of each number from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />~<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from each, so we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/4/f1470bf84cc79a1ad9170b8ff6a076ee889b0b71.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6, 16, 26, 36, 46\\]\" width=\"113\" height=\"16\" />\nThe only numbers from this list that are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. We divide both by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, yielding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is not a two-digit number, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/9/719579edfecf49b3044de7dd96766f4f59eedb8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>You can just plug in the numbers to see which one works. When you get to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, you multiply by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and add <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a21383a2b05dbe4ed4ecd095273f0cabc32b78a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. When you reverse the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a21383a2b05dbe4ed4ecd095273f0cabc32b78a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, you get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/90100e7ec57be3145070551137e9c47224adb4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />, which is within the given range. Thus, the answer is  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/9/719579edfecf49b3044de7dd96766f4f59eedb8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Fastest_Way.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Fastest_Way)\">Solution 4 (Fastest Way)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Fastest Way)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let x be the original number. The last digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/a/a9a3bab13ea1c946604b35b34dff588bca077b49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x+11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> so the last digit of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/e/70e634348f8df9eaeac4ced35db64d08a906532e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. The only answer choice that satisfies this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/9/719579edfecf49b3044de7dd96766f4f59eedb8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. This yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/4/5545d14fe113f579c8becd19d1ae6eef5c9acb22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71-11 = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/f/dcf7b8417f190f48fa57d2703a362aa3e9396961.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$72-11 = 61$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/b/0ebe6ca64fb0c0611ebc78a41502a6046b55bdba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$73-11 = 62$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/f/cffb60ecad51df2ca62631e0cab69202455108a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74-11 = 63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/2/b62aef7fede9a864a5f805350b49baf9a6dfb759.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75-11 = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" />. Of these, the only ones divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/8/848ec5b5f695afbacb864efead154761481780c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$63$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, the only possible values are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/c/38c4bc29a5a0d6756b52b0277d9cd07e756225c8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$71$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/90100e7ec57be3145070551137e9c47224adb4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$74$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"18\" height=\"12\" />. Switching the digits of each, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/6/b7616a230c77f0d9a577e5bca01aa06f1c35c457.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a21383a2b05dbe4ed4ecd095273f0cabc32b78a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Subtracting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> from each, we get the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/5/ce5d3cbb9ab0a992ed503c2d4499e4f4af2f9d65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. Dividing each by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The only two-digit number is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/9/719579edfecf49b3044de7dd96766f4f59eedb8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"64\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~TheGoldenRetriever\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_CRITICALLY_THINK.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_CRITICALLY_THINK!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO CRITICALLY THINK!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO CRITICALLY THINK!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/EbFw47vZASs\">https://youtu.be/EbFw47vZASs</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/PQnA07go4GM\">https://youtu.be/PQnA07go4GM</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zTGuz6EoBWY\">https://youtu.be/zTGuz6EoBWY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B\" title=\"2017 AMC 10B\">2017 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2017 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2017 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2017 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr